From: Philippe Simons <philippe.simons@movify.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: pm8150l: add LCDB node

PM8150L has an LCDB block at 0xec00 that biases an LCD panel. Add it
alongside the other pmic@5 children, disabled by default, so boards that
use it can enable it and describe their rail constraints.

---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pm8150l.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pm8150l.dtsi
@@ -121,6 +121,13 @@
 			status = "disabled";
 		};
 
+		pm8150l_lcdb: lcdb@ec00 {
+			compatible = "qcom,pm8150l-lcdb";
+			reg = <0xec00>;
+
+			status = "disabled";
+		};
+
 		pm8150l_lpg: pwm {
 			compatible = "qcom,pm8150l-lpg";
 
